---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import AnalystLens from "../../components/AnalystLens.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="SafarWise — Case Study" description="Full-stack AI visa platform for Pakistani travelers">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16">
    <p class="strip-label">Case Study</p>
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold">SafarWise</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-strip-accent">AI-powered visa intelligence for Pakistani passport holders</p>

    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
      {["Next.js 15", "FastAPI", "Supabase", "Gemini AI", "Systems Design"].map((t) => <span class="tag">{t}</span>)}
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 flex gap-3">
      <a href="https://safarwise.app" class="strip-btn strip-btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Live Site</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/bilalqayyum18/travelbuddy-web-app" class="strip-btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
    </div>

    <section class="mt-12 space-y-8">
      <div class="strip-card">
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-strip-signal">Context</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-strip-muted">Pakistani passport holders face fragmented visa guidance — conflicting sources, changing regulations, and document checklists that vary by destination and travel purpose. A simple oversight can delay or derail a visa application.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="strip-card">
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-strip-accent">Approach</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-strip-muted">Built a mobile-first platform combining AI-assisted visa research (Gemini + Exa grounding), SEO-indexable per-country guides, a multi-step visa search wizard, partner booking integrations, and a secure Application Portal for document uploads and status tracking.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="strip-card">
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-strip-warn">Solution</h2>
        <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 font-data text-sm text-strip-muted">
          <li>42 pages, 114+ components, 64 database migrations</li>
          <li>AI visa intel with publish-gate QA pipeline and 25+ backend tests</li>
          <li>Admin ops console: CRM, invoicing, SEO analytics, content CMS</li>
          <li>Production deployment on Vercel + Render + Supabase</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="strip-card">
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-strip-text">Effect</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-strip-muted">Live platform at safarwise.app serving Pakistani travelers with profile-specific visa guides, travel alerts, and end-to-end application workflows — reducing research time from hours of scattered searching to a single guided experience.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <AnalystLens title="Systems & Business Analyst Lens">
      <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-strip-muted">
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-data text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-strip-accent">Stakeholder Map</h3>
          <p class="mt-2">Travelers (primary), admin operations team, booking partners (Trip.com, Saily, RedteaGO), content editors.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-data text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-strip-accent">Requirements Traceability</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 font-data">Visa Search → Personalized Guide → Document Checklist → Application Portal (optional) → Status Tracking</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-data text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-strip-accent">Process: As-Is → To-Be</h3>
          <p class="mt-2"><strong class="text-strip-text">As-Is:</strong> Scattered Google searches, embassy websites, agent consultations.<br />
          <strong class="text-strip-text">To-Be:</strong> Single platform with AI-grounded guides, structured checklists, and optional hands-on application support.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </AnalystLens>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
